Yeh table ratta lagane ki cheez nahin; yeh Unit 10 ke allied angles (mutalliq angles) wale results hi hain. Inhein dobara banane ka aasan tareeqa yeh hai: \(\pi \pm \theta\) aur \(2\pi - \theta\) mein function ka naam wahi rehta hai (sin ka sin, cos ka cos), sirf sign badal sakta hai. Aur sign ka faisla quadrant (chauthai hissa) karta hai, \(\theta\) ko chhota (acute) angle maan kar:
\(\pi - \theta\) Quadrant II mein hai, jahan sirf sine positive hai;
\(\pi + \theta\) Quadrant III mein hai, jahan sirf tangent positive hai;
\(2\pi - \theta\) aur \(-\theta\) Quadrant IV mein hain, jahan sirf cosine positive hai.
Misaal ke taur par \(\cos(\pi - \theta)\): angle Quadrant II mein hai, wahan cosine negative hota hai, is liye jawab \(-\cos\theta\). Bas itni si baat hai.
